Az attached fájlt elemeztem – a Replit IDE teljes renderelt HTML forráskódja van benne (~532 000 karakter). Az összes komponenst, CSS design tokent, layout struktúrát, panelt és interakciót azonosítottam. Az alábbiakban következik a teljes, termelésre kész prompt:

***

## Elkészített Prompt

***

```
Build a complete, production-ready browser-based cloud IDE UI as a single self-contained index.html file. All HTML, CSS, and JavaScript must be embedded inline in that one file. No external dependencies may be loaded from CDNs unless they are absolutely necessary for a specific listed library (CodeMirror, xterm.js); all other styling and logic must be inlined. No placeholder, mock, stub, fake, simplified, or dummy content is permitted anywhere. Every panel, every interaction, every visual detail must be fully functional and pixel-accurate.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 1 — DESIGN SYSTEM & TOKENS
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Declare the following CSS custom properties on :root. These form the complete design token system. Every color, spacing, shadow, radius, and typography value used anywhere in the application must reference these tokens — never use hardcoded raw values.

COLOR TOKENS — DARK THEME (default):

  /* Background layers (darkest → lightest) */
  --background-root:            #0e0f14;
  --background-default:         #12141a;
  --background-higher:          #1c1e26;
  --background-highest:         #252836;
  --background-overlay:         #1a1c23;
  --surface-color:              #12141a;

  /* Foreground */
  --foreground-default:         #e8eaf0;
  --foreground-dimmer:          #9a9db0;
  --foreground-dimmest:         #545770;

  /* Outline / border */
  --outline-dimmest:            #1e2030;
  --outline-dimmer:             #252840;
  --outline-default:            #3a3d55;
  --outline-stronger:           #5a5d80;

  /* Interactive states */
  --interactive-background:           rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  --interactive-background--hover:    rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  --interactive-background--active:   rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  --interactive-border:               rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  --interactive-border--hover:        rgba(255,255,255,0.15);

  /* Accent — Primary (orange) */
  --accent-primary-dimmest:     rgba(240,120,40,0.12);
  --accent-primary-dimmer:      rgba(240,120,40,0.25);
  --accent-primary-default:     #f07828;
  --accent-primary-stronger:    #ff8c3a;
  --accent-primary-strongest:   #ffaa60;

  /* Accent — Blue */
  --accent-blue-dimmest:        rgba(24,160,251,0.12);
  --accent-blue-dimmer:         rgba(24,160,251,0.25);
  --accent-blue-default:        #18a0fb;
  --accent-blue-stronger:       #3db0ff;
  --accent-blue-strongest:      #70c8ff;

  /* Accent — Green */
  --accent-green-dimmest:       rgba(27,196,125,0.12);
  --accent-green-dimmer:        rgba(27,196,125,0.25);
  --accent-green-default:       #1bc47d;
  --accent-green-stronger:      #25d98f;
  --accent-green-strongest:     #4de8a8;

  /* Accent — Red */
  --accent-red-dimmest:         rgba(239,85,51,0.12);
  --accent-red-dimmer:          rgba(239,85,51,0.25);
  --accent-red-default:         #ef5533;
  --accent-red-stronger:        #ff6644;
  --accent-red-strongest:       #ff8866;

  /* Accent — Orange */
  --accent-orange-dimmer:       rgba(255,153,0,0.20);
  --accent-orange-default:      #ff9900;
  --accent-orange-strongest:    #ffbb44;

  /* Accent — Yellow */
  --accent-yellow-default:      #ffd700;
  --accent-yellow-strongest:    #ffe566;

  /* Accent — Purple */
  --accent-purple-dimmer:       rgba(144,124,255,0.20);
  --accent-purple-default:      #907cff;
  --accent-purple-stronger:     #a898ff;

  /* Accent — Teal */
  --accent-teal-default:        #00b5ce;
  --accent-teal-strongest:      #00d8f0;

  /* Accent — Pink */
  --accent-pink-default:        #ee46d3;
  --accent-pink-stronger:       #f560e0;

  /* Accent — Lime */
  --accent-lime-strongest:      #aaee44;

  /* Negative / warning */
  --accent-negative-default:    #ef5533;

  /* White */
  --white:                      #ffffff;

LIGHT THEME override — declare as [data-theme="light"] :root or .theme-light:

  --background-root:            #f5f5f8;
  --background-default:         #ffffff;
  --background-higher:          #f0f0f5;
  --background-highest:         #e8e8f0;
  --background-overlay:         #ffffff;
  --surface-color:              #ffffff;
  --foreground-default:         #1a1c2e;
  --foreground-dimmer:          #5a5c70;
  --foreground-dimmest:         #9a9db0;
  --outline-dimmest:            #e8e8f0;
  --outline-dimmer:             #d8d8e8;
  --outline-default:            #c0c0d8;
  --interactive-background:           rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  --interactive-background--hover:    rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  --interactive-background--active:   rgba(0,0,0,0.10);

SPACING TOKENS:
  --space-2:   2px;
  --space-4:   4px;
  --space-6:   6px;
  --space-8:   8px;
  --space-12:  12px;
  --space-16:  16px;
  --space-20:  20px;
  --space-24:  24px;
  --space-32:  32px;

BORDER RADIUS TOKENS:
  --border-radius-2:  2px;
  --border-radius-4:  4px;
  --border-radius-8:  8px;
  --border-radius-12: 12px;
  --border-radius-full: 9999px;

SHADOW TOKENS:
  --shadow-1:       0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  --shadow-default: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  --shadow-2:       0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);

TRANSITION TOKENS:
  --transition-duration-snappy:      120ms;
  --transition-timing-function-snappy: cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1);

TYPOGRAPHY TOKENS:

  Font faces — embed as @font-face using Google Fonts CDN or system fallbacks:
    - UI Font Family: "IBM Plex Sans" (weights 400, 500, 600; styles normal and italic)
      If unavailable: fallback to -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif
    - Code Font Family: "Hack" monospace (weights 400, 700; styles normal and italic)
      If unavailable: fallback to "Fira Code", "JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Code", monospace

  --font-family-default:   "IBM Plex Sans", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  --font-family-code:      "Hack", "Fira Code", "JetBrains Mono", monospace;

  --font-size-small:           11px;
  --font-size-default:         13px;
  --font-size-subhead-default: 14px;
  --font-size-subhead-big:     15px;
  --font-size-header:          16px;

  --line-height-small:    1.4;
  --line-height-default:  1.5;

  --font-weight-regular: 400;
  --font-weight-medium:  500;
  --font-weight-bold:    600;

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 2 — GLOBAL RESET & BASE STYLES
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Apply a full CSS reset:
- box-sizing: border-box on * and *::before, *::after
- margin: 0; padding: 0 on all elements
- html, body: width 100%; height 100%; overflow: hidden; background: var(--background-default); color: var(--foreground-default); font-family: var(--font-family-default); font-size: var(--font-size-default); line-height: var(--line-height-default); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale
- No text selection on UI chrome elements (buttons, icons, labels) via user-select: none; only text inside the code editor and terminal should be selectable
- Scrollbars (WebKit): width 6px, track background transparent, thumb var(--outline-default), thumb hover var(--outline-stronger), border-radius 3px
- Firefox scrollbars: scrollbar-color: var(--outline-default) transparent; scrollbar-width: thin
- Focus outlines: remove default outlines; replace with box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent-primary-default) on keyboard focus
- All interactive elements: cursor pointer; transition: background-color var(--transition-duration-snappy) var(--transition-timing-function-snappy), box-shadow var(--transition-duration-snappy) var(--transition-timing-function-snappy), color var(--transition-duration-snappy) var(--transition-timing-function-snappy), opacity var(--transition-duration-snappy) var(--transition-timing-function-snappy)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 3 — TOP-LEVEL LAYOUT
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

The application root (#app) fills the entire viewport using:
  position: fixed; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden;

The layout is divided into three horizontal regions stacked vertically:
  1. HEADER BAR — fixed height 48px, z-index 100
  2. WORKSPACE — flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: row; overflow: hidden; min-height: 0
  3. STATUS BAR — fixed height 24px, z-index 100 (optional, can be omitted if space-constrained)

The WORKSPACE row contains from left to right:
  A. ACTIVITY BAR — fixed width 48px, full height, z-index 50
  B. LEFT SIDEBAR PANEL — variable width (default 240px, resizable 100px–600px), full height
  C. EDITOR AREA — flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0
  D. RIGHT PANEL AREA — variable width (default hidden, expandable to 300px), full height (optional; show only when a right panel is active)
  E. BOTTOM PANEL AREA — variable height (default 200px, resizable), full width (housed inside the editor area column as a bottom split)

Each of B, D, E is independently collapsible. Animate open/close with width/height transitions at 200ms ease-out.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 4 — HEADER BAR
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

The header bar spans the full width at the top. Structure:
  height: 48px; background: var(--background-higher); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--space-8); gap: var(--space-8); flex-shrink: 0

LEFT SECTION (flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-8)):

  LOGO BUTTON:
    - An SVG icon representing the application logo, dimensions 28×28px
    - Use this exact path geometry for the logo SVG (gradient-filled connected nodes):
        Three nodes connected by curved lines. Node 1 at top-right, Node 2 at middle-left, Node 3 at bottom-right. Each node is a filled circle of radius 6px. Lines connecting them are cubic bezier curves, stroke-width 2.
        Apply a linear gradient fill going from top-left (#f07828) to bottom-right (#ff3cac).
    - Clicking the logo opens a dropdown menu (see Section 14: Menus).
    - width: 28px; height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0

  PROJECT NAME AREA (display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4)):
    - Owner label: span, font-size: var(--font-size-small); color: var(--foreground-dimmer); text "user"
    - Separator: span "/" color: var(--foreground-dimmest)
    - Project name: span, font-size: var(--font-size-subhead-default); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); color: var(--foreground-default); text "my-project" (editable on double-click — show inline input)
    - On hover the entire area gets background: var(--interactive-background); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); cursor: pointer
    - Clicking it opens a project switcher popover (see Section 15)

CENTER SECTION (flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-6)):

  RUN BUTTON (primary action):
    - height: 30px; padding: 0 var(--space-12); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4)
    - Background: var(--accent-primary-default); color: #fff; font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium)
    - Contains: ▶ SVG triangle play icon (16px) + text "Run"
    - On hover: background: var(--accent-primary-stronger)
    - On active/running state: background becomes var(--accent-red-default); icon becomes ■ square stop icon; text becomes "Stop"
    - Clicking toggles run/stop state; when "running" a subtle pulsing animation plays on the button (opacity 0.7→1 at 1s interval)

RIGHT SECTION (flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4)):

  INVITE BUTTON:
    - height: 30px; padding: 0 var(--space-10); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4)
    - Background: var(--interactive-background); border: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmer); color: var(--foreground-default)
    - Contains: person-plus SVG icon (16px) + text "Invite"
    - On hover: background: var(--interactive-background--hover); border-color: var(--outline-default)
    - Clicking opens the Invite Panel (see Section 10)

  USER AVATAR BUTTON:
    - 30px × 30px circular button; border-radius: 50%
    - Shows initials "U" centered in a colored background (generate color from username hash)
    - On hover: ring outline 2px var(--accent-primary-default) with 1px offset
    - Clicking opens User Settings panel (see Section 13)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 5 — ACTIVITY BAR
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Vertical strip on the far left of the workspace.
  width: 48px; background: var(--background-higher); border-right: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: var(--space-4) 0; gap: var(--space-2); flex-shrink: 0; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden

Each activity bar item is an icon button:
  width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: var(--border-radius-8); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: transparent; border: none; cursor: pointer; color: var(--foreground-dimmer); position: relative
  On hover: background: var(--interactive-background); color: var(--foreground-default)
  On active/selected: background: var(--accent-primary-dimmest); color: var(--accent-primary-default)
  When selected a 2px vertical line appears on the left edge of the item: position absolute; left: -4px; width: 2px; height: 20px; background: var(--accent-primary-default); border-radius: 0 var(--border-radius-2) var(--border-radius-2) 0

A tooltip appears on hover (right-aligned from activity bar, after 500ms delay):
  background: var(--background-highest); color: var(--foreground-default); padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--border-radius-4); font-size: var(--font-size-small); white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: var(--shadow-1); border: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmer); pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999

TOP ICONS (in order, each toggling its corresponding left sidebar panel):

  1. FILES icon (two overlapping document pages SVG, 20px):
     Tooltip: "Files" — opens/toggles File Explorer Panel

  2. AI ASSISTANT icon (three connected nodes SVG using the logo shape, 20px, gradient colored):
     Tooltip: "AI" — opens/toggles AI Chat Panel

  3. SEARCH icon (magnifying glass SVG, 20px):
     Tooltip: "Search" — opens/toggles Search Panel

  4. GIT icon (branching lines SVG, 20px):
     Tooltip: "Git" — opens/toggles Git Panel

  5. DATABASE icon (cylinder/stack SVG, 20px):
     Tooltip: "Database" — opens/toggles Database Panel

  6. KEY-VALUE icon (key SVG, 20px):
     Tooltip: "Key-Value Store" — opens/toggles KV Store Panel

  7. INTEGRATIONS icon (plug/socket SVG, 20px):
     Tooltip: "Integrations" — opens/toggles Integrations Panel

  8. SHELL icon (terminal >_ SVG, 20px):
     Note: Shell opens as a bottom panel, not a sidebar panel — clicking this toggles the bottom panel and focuses the shell tab

SEPARATOR: a 1px horizontal line, width 24px, centered, color var(--outline-dimmer), margin 4px auto

BOTTOM ICONS (pushed to bottom with margin-top: auto):

  9. SECURITY SCANNER icon (shield with checkmark SVG, 20px, color var(--accent-blue-default)):
     Tooltip: "Security Scanner" — opens Security Scanner Panel

  10. SECRETS icon (lock SVG, 20px):
      Tooltip: "Secrets" — opens Secrets Panel

  11. WORKFLOWS icon (play-list/steps SVG, 20px):
      Tooltip: "Workflows" — opens Workflows Panel

  12. DEVELOPER icon (code brackets </> SVG, 20px):
      Tooltip: "Developer" — opens Developer Panel

  13. USER SETTINGS icon (gear/cog SVG, 20px):
      Tooltip: "Settings" — opens User Settings Panel

Each icon must be drawn as inline SVG using currentColor fill, viewBox="0 0 24 24", preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMin".

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 6 — PANE / PANEL SYSTEM
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

All left sidebar panels share the same structural container (the LEFT SIDEBAR PANEL from Section 3). Only one panel is visible at a time. Switching panels slides old panel out and new panel in using a translate-X CSS transition (200ms ease-out). The pane system also supports a "back" navigation stack — each panel can push sub-views onto a stack; the back button at top-left pops the stack.

PANE WRAPPER:
  width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; background: var(--background-default)

PANE HEADER:
  height: 52px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--space-8); gap: var(--space-4); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest); background: var(--background-default)

  LEFT SECTION of PaneHeader (flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4)):
    - BACK BUTTON (32px × 32px icon button): left-pointing chevron SVG (24px). Appears only when there is a sub-view to go back to. On click, pop the navigation stack. Disabled (opacity 0.3) when at root.
    - Optional secondary icon button (context-dependent, e.g., Clock history icon for Chats)

  CENTER SECTION of PaneHeader (flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center):
    - ICON + TITLE row (display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px):
      - Panel icon: 16px × 16px inline SVG in the panel's accent color
      - Panel title: font-size: var(--font-size-subhead-default); font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium); color: var(--foreground-default); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 160px

  RIGHT SECTION of PaneHeader (flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4)):
    - MORE OPTIONS button: 36px × 36px icon button with three-vertical-dots SVG (24px). Opens a context dropdown menu.
    - Additional action buttons specific to each panel (described per-panel below)

PANE CONTENT:
  flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column

RESIZE HANDLE (between sidebar and editor):
  width: 4px; background: transparent; cursor: col-resize; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; z-index: 10
  On hover and while dragging: background: var(--accent-primary-default); opacity: 0.5
  Implement drag-to-resize: on mousedown on the handle, track mousemove on document, update the sidebar panel width via CSS custom property or inline style, clamp to 100–600px, stop on mouseup

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
SECTION 7 — FILE EXPLORER PANEL
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Panel title: "Files". Panel icon: document-pages SVG. Accent color: var(--foreground-default).

PaneHeader right-section buttons (from right to left):
  - REFRESH button: circular arrows SVG icon. On click: re-render the tree.
  - NEW FILE button: file-plus SVG icon. On click: prompt inline new file creation at root level.
  - NEW FOLDER button: folder-plus SVG icon. On click: prompt inline new folder creation at root level.

SEARCH BAR (below pane header, above tree):
  height: 32px; padding: 0 var(--space-8); background: var(--background-higher); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-dimmest)
  Input element: width 100%; background: transparent; border: none; outline: none; color: var(--foreground-default); font-size: var(--font-size-small); placeholder "Filter files…"
  Magnifying glass icon on left (12px, var(--foreground-dimmest))
  Typing filters the tree in real time, hiding non-matching entries; matching text is highlighted in var(--accent-primary-default)

FILE TREE:
  padding: var(--space-4) 0; flex: 1; overflow-y: auto

FILE/FOLDER ITEM structure (each item):
  height: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-left: calc(var(--depth) * 16px + 8px); gap: var(--space-4); cursor: pointer; user-select: none; font-size: var(--font-size-small)
  On hover: background: var(--interactive-background)
  On selected/active: background: var(--accent-primary-dimmest); color: var(--accent-primary-strongest)

  FOLDER ITEM:
    - Collapse/expand toggle: 16px × 16px chevron SVG that rotates 90° when expanded (CSS transform: rotate, transition 120ms)
    - Folder icon: 16px × 16px SVG, two styles:
        - Closed: standard folder shape, fill: var(--accent-yellow-default)
        - Open: folder with open top flap, fill: var(--accent-yellow-default)
    - Folder name text: color: var(--foreground-default)
    - Children are indented one level deeper and slide in/out with max-height animation

  FILE ITEM:
    - No chevron (replaced by 16px spacer)
    - File type icon: 16px × 16px SVG or emoji per extension:
        .js / .mjs → orange JS square; .ts / .tsx → blue TS square; .jsx → cyan JSX; .html → red angle brackets; .css / .scss / .sass → blue paint palette; .json → yellow curly braces; .md → dark blue markdown icon; .py → blue/yellow Python snake; .sh / .bash → green terminal; .txt / unknown → gray document; .png / .jpg / .gif / .svg / .webp → purple image frame; .mp4 / .webm / .mov → video camera; .zip / .tar → archive box
    - File name text: color: var(--foreground-default)
    - Modified indicator: small dot (4px, var(--accent-primary-default)) to the right of the name if the file has unsaved changes

  RIGHT-CLICK CONTEXT MENU on any item (see Section 14):
    Options for file: Rename, Duplicate, Delete, Copy Path, Open to the Side
    Options for folder: Rename, Duplicate, Delete, New File, New Folder, Copy Path, Open in Shell

INLINE RENAME: When rename is triggered, replace the name text with an input element, pre-filled with current name. On Enter or blur: commit rename. On Escape: cancel. The input matches the row's font and size exactly.

INLINE NEW FILE/FOLDER: Insert a new row at the appropriate location with a text input. The folder icon shows a "new file" or "new folder" icon. On Enter: create the file/folder node. On Escape: cancel.

